        "slc_bd8b8c55c98510613bca73584f566534fa9894ed2d1bcd40f88df76caa494f54"
      ],
      "text": "A CLI drives visible Garcon chats through a running server, supporting catalog discovery, sync/detached starts and resumes, steering, status, transcript search and reads, export, handoff, and stop controls."
    },
    {
