      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_08c514c38c101ddc8f68e9308cf19df16e8e1846bff84cbd5a9973b30ad201cb"
      ],
      "text": "The repository is organized into a SvelteKit/Svelte 5 frontend (web/), a Bun server handling chat lifecycle, providers, Git, auth, and notifications (server/), agent-specific runtimes (server-agents/), shared contracts (common/), and black-box integration tests."
    },
