        "slc_9d0bddc727b9e79e08f743b06f7e4e6c2f4e22b51a687617ccdd34bdad50ecd3"
      ],
      "text": "Running Garcon requires Bun, git, and a modern browser, plus at least one coding agent or API provider; optional pull-request support needs an authenticated GitHub CLI on the host."
    },
