      "text": "Garcon supports Claude Code, Codex, Cursor Agent, OpenCode, Amp, Factory Droid, and Pi as coding agents, plus direct Anthropic Messages and OpenAI Responses/Chat Completions compatible endpoints and provider presets like Ollama and OpenRouter."
    },
