        "slc_bd0ece6af7939c9467b634450c41bbc3651342355372490853f6338bd1ca171d"
      ],
      "text": "Model names may carry a `[Nk]` suffix (100-1000, thousands of tokens) that sets a per-chat Claude auto-compaction window; the annotation overrides CLAUDE_CODE_AUTO_COMPACT_WINDOW for that child process only and requires Claude Code 2.1.238+."
    },
