        "slc_cef3b824b7444cc7aa0cef932b3ed7c482098d13692ee19f3a54c1b134312b16"
      ],
      "text": "Chats can exchange provenance-labeled messages, launch delegated child chats, and receive their final results while keeping parentage auditable; the workspace tiles up to four resizable windows and tracks lineage in Chat Map."
    },
